  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Aqua",
    "content": "This must be the lost cave… \\nbut it’s strangely quiet.",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "0a01f495-b31e-4e98-a3e9-9af01fb5d8a4"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Ignis",
    "content": "No monsters, no traps, no \\nscary guardian?",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "ed578e6d-0512-45d8-925a-3796c75fb39d"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Aqua",
    "content": "Look over there. There’s a \\ntreasure chest!",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "260a9b2c-0cf1-4d99-bf7d-158e1a2571d9"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Ignis",
    "content": "Finally! Please let it be the \\nElement Core…",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "f0a62a4a-7828-47d7-8dce-2a823b10bb18"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Ignis",
    "content": "OH MY GOD what was that??",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "ed578e6d-0512-45d8-925a-3796c75fb39d"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Aqua",
    "content": "Wait look! It's the element\\n core!",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "260a9b2c-0cf1-4d99-bf7d-158e1a2571d9"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Aqua",
    "content": "With this, we can restore balance \\nof nature.",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "260a9b2c-0cf1-4d99-bf7d-158e1a2571d9"
    }
  },
  {
    "__type__": "EndingDialogueLine",
    "speakerName": "Ignis",
    "content": "YAYYYYY mission accomplished!",
    "portraitFrame": {
      "__uuid__": "f0a62a4a-7828-47d7-8dce-2a823b10bb18"
    }
  },
